"""Validate and display the star-shaped hub collision approximation."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
from spokes import OUT,scan
r=json.loads((OUT/'verification.json').read_text());proof=json.loads((OUT/'geometry-verification.json').read_text());renders=json.loads((OUT/'renders.json').read_text());assert len(renders['views'])==36
for row in renders['views']:assert scan.digest(Path(row['path']))==row['sha256']
assert scan.digest(Path(renders['reference_coarse_file']))==renders['reference_coarse_sha256']
for path,h in r['input_pins'].items():assert scan.digest(Path(path))==h
assert scan.digest(Path(r['candidate_collision']))==r['candidate_sha256']
paths={bank:{scope:{view:{stage:str(OUT/f'{bank}-{scope}-{view}-{stage}.webp')for stage in ['source','coarse','candidate']}for view in ['oblique','face','reverse']}for scope in ['hub','bank']}for bank in ['bank-a','bank-b']}
html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>
body{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--foreground)}p{margin:0 0 12px}.controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}select{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--background);padding:7px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);max-width:100%}.images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}figure{margin:0}figcaption{margin-bottom:6px}img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:var(--radius)}.muted{color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:13px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:13px}th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.note{padding:16px;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);margin:14px 0}</style></head><body>
<p><strong>Keep the five hub spokes; fill the middle.</strong><br>Each short fixed spoke is one convex hull. Three 12-sided sections combine into one solid center hull per bank. The long rotating target arms and all visuals remain unchanged.</p>
<div class="controls"><select id="reference" aria-label="Reference"><option value="source">Detailed collision</option><option value="coarse">Previous coarse ring</option></select><select id="bank" aria-label="Bank"><option value="bank-a">Bank A</option><option value="bank-b">Bank B</option></select><select id="scope" aria-label="Scope"><option value="hub">Fixed hub</option><option value="bank">With rotating arms</option></select><select id="camera" aria-label="Camera"><option value="oblique">Oblique</option><option value="face">Face</option><option value="reverse">Reverse</option></select></div>
<div class="images"><figure><figcaption id="beforeLabel">Detailed collision</figcaption><img id="before" alt="Rune hub collision reference"></figure><figure><figcaption>Spokes + solid center</figcaption><img id="after" alt="Five distinct spoke hulls with a solid polygonal center"></figure></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Fixed hub collision: blue reference, orange proposal. Grey long arms stay exact. Visual appearance is unchanged.</p>
<table><tr><th>Both hubs</th><th>Detailed source</th><th>Previous ring</th><th>New spokes</th></tr><tr><td>Mesh triangles</td><td>18,135</td><td>330</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>Native shapes</td><td>0</td><td>18</td><td>13 hulls</td></tr></table>
<p>Five spoke hulls + one filled center per bank, plus one separate rear-bracket hull on bank B. The gaps between the outer spokes stay open.</p>
<div class="note"><strong>One hull per spoke, with rotation clearance.</strong> The spokes stop 5 mm behind the rotating-arm sweep. The centers stay about 18.9 mm inside its radial limit. Both bounds hold for every angle of the declared rigid bank rotation. All 270 long-arm mesh payloads remain exact.</div>
<p>Spoke channels and small fittings disappear. Some forward spoke depth is trimmed for clearance; projected spoke recession reaches about 11.8 mm. The middle is deliberately solid, so previous center entry/exposure is not preserved.</p>
<p class="muted">Whole Rune: 94,523 remaining mesh triangles + 13 hulls. Whole map: 386,522 mesh triangles + 80 cylinders, 8 boxes, 33 hulls. Runtime performance, independent target articulation and contact behavior remain untested. Geometry, ownership, motion names, visual hashes and stage counts pass. Nothing installed or committed; grouped native loading is still outstanding.</p>
<script>const paths=PATHS;function update(){const p=paths[bank.value][scope.value][camera.value];before.src=p[reference.value];after.src=p.candidate;beforeLabel.textContent=reference.selectedOptions[0].text;}for(const id of ['reference','bank','scope','camera'])document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('change',update);update();console.log('Spoke hulls + filled centers: 36 matched images');</script></body></html>'''.replace('PATHS',json.dumps(paths))
(OUT/'gallery.html').write_text(html)
hashes={str(p.relative_to(OUT)):scan.digest(p)for p in OUT.rglob('*')if p.is_file()and p.name not in ['gallery.html','final-verification.json']}
(OUT/'final-verification.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(geometry=proof,matched_images=36,artifact_sha256=hashes,installed=False),indent=2)+'\n');print('Verified source pins, geometry and 36 matched images.')
